The underlying PhysioNet dataset (GE-79, CDED/1.0.1) is subject to PhysioNet's
credentialed-access and citation terms. Access and use must comply with:

Novak, V., & Quispe, R. (2020). Cerebral-perfusion-diabetes-elderly (version 1.0.1). 
